{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"schedule","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"actor","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Actor","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Actor"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"named","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"name","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"timetable","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Timetable","preciseIdentifier":"s:11GnustoClock9TimetableV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Timetable"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TimedEvent","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV","text":"TimedEvent","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"actor","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Whose day this is.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"name","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The daemon’s name, unique across the whole game."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"timetable","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The day to keep."}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"return-value","level":2,"text":"Return Value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The timed event, for the game’s "},{"code":"timers","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" block.","type":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This is the deterministic counterpart to ","type":"text"},{"code":"GnustoActors","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’ ","type":"text"},{"code":"roams","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"announcement discipline is the same — the departure line prints only if","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the player is standing in the room being left, the arrival line only in","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the room being entered, and neither in the dark — but nothing here draws","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from the seeded random stream, because a suspect whose movements are a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"coin flip has no alibi worth checking."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Movement is a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"teleport to the scheduled room, with no exit-graph"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"awareness"}]},{"text":": a locked door on the route will not stop him. The contract","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"a timetable is keeping is that he "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"is"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" in the study at a quarter past —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"not that he plausibly got there.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the physical journey matters, there are two ways to say so and they"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are not interchangeable:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Make the room he passes through a stop of its own.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" He is really"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"there, so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"location(of:at:)"},{"type":"text","text":" will say so and any testimony read off"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the timetable inherits it. Costs a tick: for him to be "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"seen"}]},{"type":"text","text":" there"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the stop has to land on a time the clock actually samples, which on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a multi-minute turn means taking one off a neighbouring leg. A stop"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"that falls between two samples is jumped — its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"perform:"},{"text":" still runs,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on the tick that passes it, but nobody watched him arrive or leave.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Say it from the stop that already moves him"}]},{"type":"text","text":", with a "},{"code":"perform:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"closure and "},{"code":"say(_:from:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" naming the room passed through. The line"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"prints on the same turn as that stop’s own departure and arrival, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in that room only. The timetable does not learn anything — he is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"still a teleport, and a lookup will not place him on the grass — so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"take this one when the crossing is ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"narration","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" and the stop times are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"load-bearing elsewhere.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Sources\/Fulminate","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" uses both: five actors on stops, and one crossing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose middle leg is a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"perform:"},{"type":"text","text":" line because the minutes on either side"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of it are quoted by a witness."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An actor with no room — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vanish()"},{"type":"text","text":"ed, shut in a chest, carried off —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"idles: the daemon keeps his place in the day but moves him nowhere and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"runs no stop’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"perform:"},{"type":"text","text":", so when he is put down again he goes where"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the day says he is "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"now"}]},{"type":"text","text":", and the stops that came round while he was"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"gone stay unperformed rather than all firing at once. An actor merely"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"moved"}]},{"type":"text","text":" somewhere off his route, by contrast, walks back on the next"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tick, because a timetable means he goes where he is supposed to be."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To take him off his rounds for good — arrested, murdered, sent away —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"call "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stopDaemon(_:)"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The daemon’s first tick seeds his place from the opening time and runs","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"nothing: the stop in force when the game opens has not ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"come round"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a 9:00 stop’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"perform:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" does not fire on turn one of a game that opens","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"at half past five.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"After that, a tick either "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"walks","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"lands"}]},{"type":"text","text":", and which one depends"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on the gap since the tick before it. A tick one turn after the last one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"walks: every stop it passed runs its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"perform:"},{"type":"text","text":", in order, wrapping at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"midnight, which is what makes a clock running fifteen minutes to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"turn honest about stops five minutes apart. Any other tick lands — he"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"goes where the day says he is "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"now"}]},{"text":", the stop in force runs, and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ones the gap flew over stay unperformed. That is the answer for a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"daemon started again some turns after ","type":"text"},{"code":"stopDaemon(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", for a clock","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"moved by ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/advance(by:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/set(to:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", and for a rewind, none of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which mean he spent the interval walking his route. Inside a walk the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"place is written before each ","type":"text"},{"code":"perform:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so a body that throws leaves","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that stop kept and the next tick picks up at the one after it.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Timer names are global across a game; the convention here is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"<actor>.day\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]}],"metadata":{"extendedModule":"GnustoClock","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"GnustoClock"}],"title":"schedule(_:named:_:)","externalID":"s:11GnustoClock0B0V8schedule_5named_0A010TimedEventVAF5ActorV_SSAA9TimetableVtF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"schedule","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV","text":"Actor","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"named","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11GnustoClock9TimetableV","text":"Timetable","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV","text":"TimedEvent","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustoclock\/clock\/schedule(_:named:_:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Puts an actor on a timetable: a daemon that keeps them where their day"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"says they should be."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/schedule(_:named:_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock","doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock"]]},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://GnustoClock/documentation/GnustoClock/Timetable":{"title":"Timetable","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Timetable"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"An actor’s day, written down: a list of stops the clock walks them through.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Timetable"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoclock\/timetable","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Timetable"},"doc://GnustoClock/documentation/GnustoClock/Clock/advance(by:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoclock\/clock\/advance(by:)","title":"advance(by:)","role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Moves the clock by some minutes without the player spending turns —","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"for an interlude the prose skips over. Negative values rewind, but an","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"alarm that has already fired stays fired."}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"advance","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"by","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/advance(by:)","kind":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoClock/documentation/GnustoClock/Clock/set(to:)":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/set(to:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"set","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"to","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TimeOfDay","preciseIdentifier":"s:11GnustoClock9TimeOfDayV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoclock\/clock\/set(to:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Moves the clock "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"forward"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" to the next occurrence of a time, at or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after now. Setting it to the current time does nothing; setting it to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"an earlier one lands tomorrow, so the day count never runs backwards.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"set(to:)","type":"topic"},"doc://GnustoClock/documentation/GnustoClock":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock","title":"GnustoClock","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoclock","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Puts a wall clock over the engine’s turn counter, so a game can be played"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"against an evening rather than a move count."}]},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/Actor":{"title":"Actor","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Actor","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A character in the world — a troll, a thief, a parrot."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Actor","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Actor","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/actor","kind":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoClock/documentation/GnustoClock/Clock":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Clock"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoclock\/clock","abstract":[{"text":"A wall clock over the turn counter: a game where it is twenty to six, and","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"ten to six four turns later.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Clock","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"Clock"},"doc://GnustoClock/documentation/GnustoClock/Clock/schedule(_:named:_:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoclock\/clock\/schedule(_:named:_:)","title":"schedule(_:named:_:)","role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Puts an actor on a timetable: a daemon that keeps them where their day"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"says they should be."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"schedule"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV","text":"Actor","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"named","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11GnustoClock9TimetableV","text":"Timetable","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV","text":"TimedEvent","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/schedule(_:named:_:)","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/TimedEvent":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/timedevent","title":"TimedEvent","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"TimedEvent"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A named timed event, declared in a game or bundle "},{"code":"timers","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" block: a fuse"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"(fires once, N turns after it is started) or a daemon (runs at the end of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every turn while active). The body is registered at bootstrap and never","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"serialized; only the schedule — name → turns remaining, or the active","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"flag — lives in ","type":"text"},{"code":"WorldState","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so it saves and restores like any other","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"state and a restore re-binds it to the declared body by name.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TimedEvent"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TimedEvent","kind":"symbol"}}}